WEBVTT

00:08.770 --> 00:10.860
I apologize for the inconvenience.

00:10.860 --> 00:12.810
Fujiwara no Teika here.

00:12.810 --> 00:15.270
We've got some construction
work going on here.

00:15.270 --> 00:18.370
Hello!  Utsunomiya no Yoritsuna here!

00:18.370 --> 00:21.620
Yoritsuna-kun hired me to
compile the Hyakunin Isshu.

00:21.620 --> 00:26.260
Fujiwara

00:21.890 --> 00:26.250
About a third of the poems were written
by members of the Fujiwara clan.

00:26.710 --> 00:28.660
I'm also a member of the Fujiwara clan,

00:28.660 --> 00:31.580
and Yoritsuna-kun is also a relative.

00:31.580 --> 00:36.220
Yes!  There were a lot of Fujiwaras
in the palace back then.

00:36.220 --> 00:37.550
Indeed.

00:37.550 --> 00:39.500
If someone asked for a Fujiwara-kun,

00:39.500 --> 00:42.020
everyone would respond.

00:42.410 --> 00:44.130
That's a little scary.

00:44.130 --> 00:47.540
So today, we have a love story between

00:47.540 --> 00:49.730
two members of the Fujiwara clan.

00:50.150 --> 00:53.680
They were cousins who were very close.

00:53.680 --> 00:55.030
T-Teika-kun?!

00:55.990 --> 00:57.970
This could get ugly.

02:32.970 --> 02:36.000
Fujiwara no Yoshitaka was born the son

02:36.000 --> 02:37.680
of the Regent Chancellor of the Realm.

02:38.260 --> 02:39.930
Yoshitaka-sama!

02:40.450 --> 02:42.120
Good morning.

02:42.120 --> 02:43.680
It's very warm this morning.

02:44.060 --> 02:48.060
Yes, I hope you have a wonderful day.

02:48.060 --> 02:52.550
He was a dedicated man
and very handsome,

02:52.550 --> 02:55.320
which made him popular
with the ladies in the palace

02:55.320 --> 02:57.540
and a promising young
man in the eyes of all.

02:58.780 --> 03:01.580
He had a fiancée.

03:02.030 --> 03:04.490
Yoshitaka & the Daughter
of Minamoto
no Yasumitsu

03:02.030 --> 03:04.490
Fujiwara no Yoshitaka

03:10.520 --> 03:12.060
Excuse me.

03:28.940 --> 03:30.600
I have a letter.

03:37.200 --> 03:39.790
There is a letter from Yoshitaka-sama.

03:40.450 --> 03:42.570
Oh, please set it over there.

04:04.000 --> 04:05.250
Magnificent!

04:05.250 --> 04:06.560
Very impressive.

04:07.370 --> 04:08.590
Michitaka-sama...

04:08.590 --> 04:10.700
He looks like he couldn't hurt a fly,

04:10.700 --> 04:12.320
yet he's skilled with a bow.

04:13.040 --> 04:16.220
What can't you do, Yoshitaka?

04:16.220 --> 04:18.730
Did you need something, Michitaka?

04:19.150 --> 04:20.990
Yeah, it's my old man.

04:21.900 --> 04:23.700
Kaneie-dono?

04:24.640 --> 04:26.570
The ghost of a warrior?

04:26.570 --> 04:30.480
Yes, in the ruined temple outside Sakyo.

04:30.480 --> 04:32.500
It comes out at night.

04:32.500 --> 04:35.430
Are you scared?  Are you scared?

04:35.430 --> 04:39.380
Why does he remain in the mortal world?

04:40.850 --> 04:43.220
It's a sad story.

04:44.190 --> 04:47.370
The warrior was a guard in the palace.

04:47.370 --> 04:50.740
He was unhappy and left for Bando.

04:50.740 --> 04:53.720
However, he had one regret.

04:53.720 --> 04:55.770
He left his woman behind in the capital.

04:56.290 --> 04:59.940
He intended to return for her, but...

05:01.150 --> 05:03.340
The woman, believing
she had been abandoned,

05:03.340 --> 05:04.950
took her own life.

05:04.950 --> 05:08.660
The warrior was filled with remorse.

05:08.660 --> 05:09.950
The end.

05:10.330 --> 05:13.870
The warrior is still
unable to pass on.

05:13.870 --> 05:15.470
A tragic tale.

05:16.030 --> 05:19.590
I will visit the temple tonight
and pray for his soul.

05:17.610 --> 05:19.590
I'll be leaving now.

05:19.590 --> 05:21.480
Commendable, Yoshitaka.

05:21.480 --> 05:22.920
I'm very impressed.

05:23.210 --> 05:25.190
Michitaka, go with him.

05:25.190 --> 05:26.270
Wh-Why?!

05:26.270 --> 05:30.270
You should follow Yoshitaka's
example and practice Buddhism.

05:30.270 --> 05:32.220
Think of it as a test of courage.

05:34.410 --> 05:39.260
The other day, I saw this total
babe in the servants' quarters.

05:39.800 --> 05:41.860
I felt obligated to make a move.

05:43.300 --> 05:45.780
Wh-What about you?

05:46.310 --> 05:49.330
Are you getting along with
Yasumitsu-dono's daughter?

05:49.330 --> 05:52.240
Yes, we exchange letters.

05:52.240 --> 05:53.200
Oh.

05:53.430 --> 05:55.660
S-So, is she pretty?

05:56.270 --> 05:59.910
I've only seen her from behind,

05:59.910 --> 06:01.900
but her hair is lovely.

06:01.900 --> 06:04.340
She has a pet cat.

06:04.590 --> 06:05.680
Wait, wait, wait!

06:05.680 --> 06:08.340
You're saying you haven't had a
chance to sit down with her?

06:08.340 --> 06:09.300
Yes.

06:09.670 --> 06:11.070
Why not?

06:11.070 --> 06:13.270
You've been talking
with her for a while.

06:13.270 --> 06:15.680
I'm waiting until the autumn
appointment ceremony.

06:16.070 --> 06:18.130
I believe there will be more

06:18.130 --> 06:20.020
prestige for her family
if my rank is higher.

06:20.020 --> 06:21.690
There you go again.

06:21.690 --> 06:23.990
You're too serious, too aloof.

06:23.990 --> 06:25.810
If all you do is exchange
letters forever,

06:25.810 --> 06:27.870
she'll get worried.

06:27.870 --> 06:31.370
"Is he unhappy with our betrothal?"

06:32.570 --> 06:35.620
It's fine.  I've told her
how I feel in my letters.

06:35.620 --> 06:37.850
You can't let your
letters do the talking.

06:37.850 --> 06:40.110
Sometimes, you have to take action!

06:40.110 --> 06:42.330
It doesn't matter if
you're a little rough.

06:42.860 --> 06:46.430
Women love it when men
show their strength.

06:46.430 --> 06:49.300
That's what men want to think.

06:49.730 --> 06:51.830
She is a virtuous woman.

06:51.830 --> 06:54.180
She wouldn't want me
to be rough with her.

06:54.180 --> 06:55.590
You're wrong!

06:55.590 --> 06:58.720
You're making her suffer by
beautifying her like that!

06:58.720 --> 06:59.670
Go see her!

06:59.670 --> 07:01.060
Calm down, Michitaka.

07:01.510 --> 07:03.720
Why are you so impatient?

07:03.720 --> 07:04.910
Huh?

07:04.910 --> 07:06.590
Well...

07:06.590 --> 07:09.030
I need to talk about something else.

07:09.900 --> 07:13.830
I'm scared.  I really can't
handle tests of courage.

07:13.830 --> 07:15.490
I-I see...

07:19.890 --> 07:21.250
Are you really going?

07:21.980 --> 07:25.970
I didn't entirely believe
your father's story,

07:25.970 --> 07:29.880
but if there's someone who's
suffering, I can't abandon him.

07:29.880 --> 07:32.670
What if the ghost kills us?!

07:32.670 --> 07:34.890
I'm fine with that.

07:35.310 --> 07:39.560
It's only right to try to help.

07:40.150 --> 07:41.780
You see, Michitaka...

07:43.150 --> 07:45.740
I've decided to live
every day to the fullest,

07:45.740 --> 07:48.620
so I'll have no regrets.

07:48.620 --> 07:51.900
That way, I'm always ready to die.

07:52.220 --> 07:53.360
Really...

07:53.360 --> 07:55.820
Unfortunately, I have a
lot of regrets left.

08:09.880 --> 08:11.420
This place has been trashed.

08:11.420 --> 08:13.280
We should clean it up.

08:13.280 --> 08:15.180
Yeah, when it's light outside.

08:16.170 --> 08:17.970
See?  There's nobody here.

08:17.970 --> 08:18.810
Let's go home.

08:19.640 --> 08:21.580
Wait, I want to...

08:25.400 --> 08:27.150
There it is!

08:28.980 --> 08:30.630
L-Let's run away, Yoshitaka!

08:30.630 --> 08:31.690
Michitaka.

08:35.450 --> 08:39.240
Kanjizai Bosatsu Gyo
Jin Hannya Haramita Ji

08:36.600 --> 08:39.830
Moron!

08:39.240 --> 08:43.210
Sho Ken Go Un Kai Ku Do
Issai Ku Yaku Sharishi

08:39.830 --> 08:41.540
We're dead!  We're dead!  We're dead!

08:41.540 --> 08:42.450
He'll kill us!

08:42.450 --> 08:43.760
He's got a sword!

08:43.210 --> 08:47.670
Shiki Fu I Ku Ku Fu I Shiki Shiki
Soku Ze Ku Ku Soku Ze Shiki

09:06.750 --> 09:07.810
Who is there?

09:08.710 --> 09:11.240
I apologize for disturbing your sleep.

09:11.850 --> 09:14.150
I am Fujiwara no Yoshitaka.

09:17.380 --> 09:21.040
I was not aware that you would
be paying a visit tonight.

09:21.040 --> 09:22.610
I am very sorry.

09:23.100 --> 09:25.610
Something unexpected came up.

09:26.120 --> 09:28.460
What do you mean?

09:28.460 --> 09:31.760
You see, a few hours ago,

09:31.760 --> 09:32.960
I almost died.

09:37.600 --> 09:38.830
Boring.

09:38.830 --> 09:39.430
Huh?

09:39.990 --> 09:42.140
No fun at all.

09:42.140 --> 09:44.350
You didn't turn pale or anything.

09:44.820 --> 09:46.190
F-Father!

09:46.190 --> 09:48.810
Uncle, what is the meaning of this?

09:48.810 --> 09:51.960
I wanted to give my aloof
nephew a little scare.

09:51.960 --> 09:53.960
Call it a test of courage.

09:56.600 --> 09:58.640
It was all a farce.

09:58.640 --> 10:00.740
But I thought I was going to die.

10:01.540 --> 10:04.250
That was an unfortunate incident.

10:04.250 --> 10:05.330
You're absolutely right.

10:05.920 --> 10:09.750
So, why did you come here?

10:10.380 --> 10:13.130
When I was convinced that I would die,

10:13.700 --> 10:15.790
I thought of you.

10:17.770 --> 10:20.360
I realized that I didn't want to die until

10:20.360 --> 10:21.760
I was able to see you properly.

10:22.610 --> 10:25.320
I do not want to have
any regrets when I die,

10:25.770 --> 10:28.020
so I came to see you.

10:29.790 --> 10:33.480
Now that you've met with me,

10:33.480 --> 10:36.030
you no longer have any regrets?

10:40.340 --> 10:41.700
No.

10:42.240 --> 10:44.660
Now that I'm here,

10:45.510 --> 10:48.540
I wish to have a closer look at you.

10:55.820 --> 10:59.090
I wish to live a long life

11:01.180 --> 11:04.240
by your side.

11:10.460 --> 11:14.020
I never realized that
I was such a greedy person.

11:15.190 --> 11:18.610
I've been waiting for
you, Yoshitaka-sama.

11:19.000 --> 11:20.870
Did I keep you waiting?

11:21.410 --> 11:24.290
Yes, you would only send me letters.

11:24.290 --> 11:26.870
There were no signs that
you would ever visit.

11:27.290 --> 11:29.440
I was very worried.

11:31.250 --> 11:32.500
That's a shock.

11:32.960 --> 11:36.550
I guess that Michitaka understands
women better than I do.

11:36.550 --> 11:38.280
What do you mean?

11:40.670 --> 11:42.550
The night is young.

11:43.330 --> 11:46.050
We have plenty of time to talk.

11:47.700 --> 11:50.980
Yoshitaka-sama...

11:53.410 --> 11:57.810
For you, I would have given up my life.

11:57.810 --> 12:00.940
Now together, I guard it dear.

12:02.630 --> 12:06.920
I was prepared to die, until I met you.

12:07.640 --> 12:09.490
Now that we are together,

12:09.490 --> 12:13.830
I wish to always be by your side.

12:15.960 --> 12:21.340
Three years later, Yoshitaka
died at the young age of 21.

12:22.880 --> 12:29.010
Did he enjoy the brief time
he had with his beloved?

12:36.570 --> 12:38.430
I like the expression on his face.

12:38.430 --> 12:41.320
He looks just like me with his
mouth pulled tight, doesn't he?

12:41.520 --> 12:43.660
This is Yoshitaka-sama's son.

12:45.020 --> 12:49.280
You should find yourself
a wife, Michitaka-sama.

12:49.570 --> 12:52.820
I'll make sure to find a real beauty.

12:52.820 --> 12:54.040
Isn't that right, boy?

12:56.000 --> 12:58.500
Ko no Naishi
& Michitaka

12:56.000 --> 12:58.500
The Mother of Gido Sanshi

13:01.180 --> 13:02.800
Women are boring creatures.

13:03.760 --> 13:08.100
Noble men make a practice
of taking multiple wives.

13:08.100 --> 13:13.470
The ideal woman must be
complacent and servile.

13:15.760 --> 13:18.340
Does such a woman exist?

13:21.610 --> 13:24.610
Come on, Ko no Naishi...

13:24.610 --> 13:27.570
I would make a poor match for you.

13:27.570 --> 13:30.120
No, that's not important!

13:30.120 --> 13:31.080
As long as there's love!

13:31.080 --> 13:32.040
Marry me!

13:33.750 --> 13:36.840
This man is the son of a noble.

13:36.840 --> 13:39.560
At best, he would only toy with
me and then cast me aside.

13:37.250 --> 13:40.590
No?  Why are you so stubborn?

13:41.080 --> 13:45.930
Michitaka-sama, you should be
more serious about marriage.

13:47.200 --> 13:49.940
If you fail to pick a suitable wife,

13:49.940 --> 13:53.010
you will find your life very difficult.

13:53.470 --> 13:54.540
Yeah...

13:55.530 --> 14:00.940
but I think it's more meaningful to
marry for love, not bloodlines.

14:01.350 --> 14:05.150
You must not say such things.

14:05.150 --> 14:08.240
Besides, how would you benefit
by taking me as your wife?

14:08.540 --> 14:11.200
Do you want to hear my life plans?

14:11.660 --> 14:14.620
I've got everything mapped out!

14:15.110 --> 14:17.710
We get married and have lots of kids.

14:17.710 --> 14:20.960
They'll be cute because they
were born out of love.

14:21.580 --> 14:24.710
I will work hard for
you and our children.

14:25.250 --> 14:27.800
I'll do my best to ensure
that our children and

14:27.800 --> 14:29.590
grandchildren live in prosperity!

14:30.120 --> 14:34.550
You will give my life
love, hope, and joy!

14:34.550 --> 14:36.350
When I first saw you,

14:36.350 --> 14:39.880
I was immediately able
to see such a future.

14:40.660 --> 14:44.320
You're the only woman
I want as my first wife!

14:44.550 --> 14:46.740
So please...

14:47.130 --> 14:47.930
Marry me.

14:49.910 --> 14:50.810
Who's there?!

14:50.810 --> 14:51.520
Um...

14:52.330 --> 14:55.330
Sorry to interrupt your conversation,

14:55.330 --> 14:58.330
but you should get back
to work, Michitaka.

14:58.330 --> 14:59.610
Yoshitaka-sama...

14:59.610 --> 15:00.490
What's wrong with you?!

15:00.490 --> 15:01.960
Don't interfere with my love!

15:01.960 --> 15:03.780
Well, the general is angry.

15:03.780 --> 15:04.590
What?!

15:04.590 --> 15:06.970
He's wondering why you
haven't returned yet.

15:07.810 --> 15:09.490
I'm sorry, Ko no Naishi!

15:09.490 --> 15:11.890
It's sad, but we'll have to
continue this another time!

15:11.890 --> 15:13.050
Y-Yes...

15:13.350 --> 15:17.350
I hope to have your response next time!

15:18.440 --> 15:20.080
Oh, sorry.

15:20.080 --> 15:21.520
I'll have that fixed.

15:21.520 --> 15:26.170
I should apologize for
interfering with your work.

15:26.170 --> 15:28.970
No, he tends to lose sight

15:28.970 --> 15:31.700
of everything else when he's focused,

15:31.700 --> 15:34.140
but that means he's sincere
about devoting himself

15:34.140 --> 15:35.770
to you once you're married.

15:35.770 --> 15:37.800
I hope that you accept.

15:38.330 --> 15:39.710
You jest...

15:40.160 --> 15:43.560
He would never devote himself to me.

15:44.510 --> 15:46.580
Why would you say that?

15:46.580 --> 15:48.850
He visits many women.

15:49.280 --> 15:52.260
I'm merely one of the flock.

15:52.890 --> 15:56.620
He isn't as fickle as rumor may have it.

15:56.620 --> 15:59.950
That may be true now,
but people change.

16:01.100 --> 16:02.340
I see...

16:02.820 --> 16:06.560
You've seen the ugly side of men

16:06.560 --> 16:07.890
while working in the palace.

16:08.360 --> 16:11.170
Well, if you wish to be a first wife,

16:11.170 --> 16:13.520
you should give up on Michitaka.

16:13.520 --> 16:15.660
No, I would never do
such an appalling thing...

16:16.090 --> 16:18.960
I've heard that a marriage
is being arranged.

16:18.960 --> 16:19.930
What?

16:19.930 --> 16:23.960
My uncle is hoping to improve
his son's standing.

16:24.380 --> 16:26.670
A decision will be made soon.

16:28.200 --> 16:30.050
That's wonderful.

16:30.620 --> 16:33.920
A man's wife can determine
his advancement in life.

16:34.490 --> 16:36.350
You're very understanding.

16:36.680 --> 16:39.560
I dare say that you are the ideal woman.

16:40.180 --> 16:44.600
No, that's not true.

16:46.790 --> 16:50.290
No woman feels untroubled
by an unfaithful husband.

16:50.980 --> 16:55.940
They hide their pain and
swallow their worries.

16:56.310 --> 17:01.000
I've rejected every suitor
because I didn't want

17:01.000 --> 17:03.260
to experience that suffering.

17:05.460 --> 17:11.020
Why have I fallen for that man?

17:12.310 --> 17:13.480
Ko no Naishi?

17:14.020 --> 17:16.800
Oh, good.  You're still awake.

17:17.140 --> 17:20.520
Man, the palace is so dark at night.

17:20.520 --> 17:22.010
Please leave.

17:22.010 --> 17:24.670
What?  I've never seen you so hostile.

17:24.670 --> 17:27.690
We wouldn't want your betrothed
to get the wrong idea.

17:27.690 --> 17:28.790
Huh?

17:28.790 --> 17:30.810
You will soon be engaged, yes?

17:30.810 --> 17:33.020
Gah!  Wh-Who told you that?!

17:33.020 --> 17:34.490
I-I've heard the rumors.

17:35.740 --> 17:37.540
I understand that you wish to

17:37.540 --> 17:39.350
fool around before your marriage,

17:39.350 --> 17:40.820
but you should consider how it feels

17:40.820 --> 17:42.160
to be on the receiving end.

17:43.170 --> 17:44.740
How many women have

17:44.740 --> 17:48.420
heard that speech you gave me today?

17:48.640 --> 17:50.340
Don't assume you can run roughshod

17:50.340 --> 17:52.000
over me because of my lowborn status!

17:52.000 --> 17:55.300
I still have my pride!

18:01.220 --> 18:02.770
Forgive me.

18:03.410 --> 18:04.890
I didn't mean to say that.

18:05.770 --> 18:08.570
You must think that I have an ugly soul.

18:08.570 --> 18:11.040
Do not come back to see me.

18:11.040 --> 18:12.900
I turned down the marriage
offer a while back.

18:13.670 --> 18:15.200
I don't know where you heard that,

18:15.200 --> 18:18.530
but I never thought you would
bring up such ancient history.

18:18.530 --> 18:19.870
Wh-Why?

18:19.870 --> 18:22.320
Now, I'm somewhat of a womanizer,

18:22.320 --> 18:24.160
so I can understand
why you're suspicious,

18:24.790 --> 18:26.530
but I would never say anything
that I didn't mean.

18:27.720 --> 18:30.250
I truly want to make you my first wife.

18:30.610 --> 18:33.850
However, if my parents
choose a wife for me,

18:33.850 --> 18:37.010
I would naturally have to
make her my first wife.

18:37.530 --> 18:40.290
But that would negate your position,

18:40.890 --> 18:42.510
so I refused.

18:43.320 --> 18:46.090
I will not resign the woman
I love to the shadows.

18:48.510 --> 18:50.570
So will you accept?

18:51.480 --> 18:53.290
If you turn me down...

18:53.730 --> 18:55.520
I beg you, Ko no Naishi!

18:56.280 --> 18:57.370
Takako.

18:58.340 --> 19:00.500
My name is Takako.

19:01.730 --> 19:05.410
Please call me by my
name, Michitaka-sama.

19:06.930 --> 19:07.910
Takako!

19:09.310 --> 19:12.620
So you agree?  You'll marry me?

19:12.620 --> 19:14.730
As long as you promise me one thing.

19:14.730 --> 19:16.170
Sure, anything you want!

19:16.670 --> 19:18.910
I'll always be number one in your heart!

19:18.910 --> 19:19.730
Sure!

19:19.730 --> 19:21.020
Never forget...

19:21.020 --> 19:24.470
You'll be mine alone for
the rest of your life.

19:24.470 --> 19:25.890
That's perfect!

19:25.890 --> 19:29.830
I like the passion
behind that cool demeanor!

19:30.240 --> 19:31.550
I love you, Takako!

19:32.090 --> 19:33.770
I'll make you happy for
the rest of your life!

19:36.980 --> 19:38.490
Ko no Naishi.

19:39.160 --> 19:41.690
I heard that everything worked
out between you and Michitaka.

19:41.690 --> 19:42.700
Congratulations.

19:42.990 --> 19:46.100
Yes, thanks to you...

19:46.100 --> 19:49.140
Oh?  Did I do something?

19:49.570 --> 19:51.490
You must have known that

19:51.490 --> 19:53.610
he turned down the arranged marriage.

19:54.360 --> 19:56.000
You're very sharp.

19:56.600 --> 19:59.470
I felt a push was necessary
to spur you into action.

19:59.470 --> 20:03.020
Regardless, that was a cruel lie.

20:03.020 --> 20:08.720
Well, I wasn't happy to know that
you didn't trust my friend.

20:09.160 --> 20:10.700
Forgive me.

20:11.280 --> 20:13.780
He's a very devoted man.

20:14.240 --> 20:16.120
The rumors you've heard

20:16.120 --> 20:18.840
refer to when he was
searching for "the one."

20:19.410 --> 20:22.210
He finally found you.

20:22.810 --> 20:24.570
I'm sure he'll make you happy.

20:25.040 --> 20:27.750
Yes, I know.

20:28.310 --> 20:29.330
That's good.

20:29.750 --> 20:32.300
I hope you live long and happy lives.

20:33.870 --> 20:37.500
Hey, why are you going back
to your parents' home?

20:37.500 --> 20:39.710
I've made preparations
to move you to my home.

20:40.120 --> 20:41.860
I can't do that.

20:41.860 --> 20:44.490
Until our parents have agreed,

20:44.490 --> 20:46.660
you must visit me as a suitor.

20:46.660 --> 20:49.680
I'm intimidated by that
scholar dad of yours.

20:50.310 --> 20:51.980
Right, I'll do my best.

20:52.620 --> 20:55.940
Then I'll bring you home
once you're with child.

20:55.940 --> 20:59.630
My, that is an unusually wise decision.

20:59.630 --> 21:00.470
Indeed.

21:01.050 --> 21:03.110
Nobody can complain then.

21:03.920 --> 21:06.290
You'll be my number one.

21:07.260 --> 21:12.120
I may be happy now,
but I'm still worried.

21:13.310 --> 21:16.040
Men grow in the outside world.

21:16.690 --> 21:19.790
There is no guarantee that
your feelings won't change.

21:20.430 --> 21:22.480
That is why I cannot help but feel...

21:25.650 --> 21:27.400
My fear is that you

21:27.400 --> 21:29.480
will forget your promise
to never forget me,

21:30.020 --> 21:32.850
so I would prefer to die
now while I am still happy.

21:34.640 --> 21:37.730
You promise to love me for
the rest of your life,

21:37.730 --> 21:39.760
but the human heart is fickle.

21:40.440 --> 21:42.820
That is why I would rather die today.

21:43.530 --> 21:45.760
I would rather die in bliss...

21:49.280 --> 21:51.240
Michitaka             Afterwards

21:50.160 --> 21:53.450
After that, Takako gave
birth to Michitaka's child,

21:53.450 --> 21:56.170
and Michitaka was able to
make Takako his first wife.

21:58.960 --> 22:00.790
His daughter married into money.

22:03.400 --> 22:04.800
He was named the Regent Advisor.

22:06.800 --> 22:09.050
Matsugimi, I'll teach you poetry.

22:09.400 --> 22:10.760
A grandson to spoil.

22:10.760 --> 22:12.720
I have class...

22:11.850 --> 22:12.720
Yes, yes.

22:13.150 --> 22:14.770
He spoiled him.

22:16.970 --> 22:18.830
It's been a long time, Michitaka.

22:18.830 --> 22:20.530
Oh, Yoshitaka.

22:20.530 --> 22:21.980
Did you live a long life?

22:22.330 --> 22:25.670
Yep, but I still have so many regrets.

22:25.670 --> 22:27.170
Wait...

22:27.170 --> 22:28.810
Am I a ghost?

22:28.810 --> 22:29.780
Scary!

22:29.780 --> 22:30.870
I'm scary!

22:31.190 --> 22:32.910
You haven't changed.

22:32.910 --> 22:34.910
Poetic Tale 7:

22:32.910 --> 22:34.910
END

24:04.960 --> 24:24.000
Next
Episode

24:04.960 --> 24:24.000
Mount Suenomatsu

24:04.960 --> 24:24.000
Kiyohara no Motosuke

24:06.340 --> 24:09.950
When I must hide these burning feelings,

24:09.950 --> 24:15.890
I feel as though my body is
on fire with Ibuki mugwort.
